  "instance_name": "seagull_naming_convention",
  "label": "seagull naming convention",
  "description": "The common practice of referring to the gull family of birds (genus Larus) as 'seagulls' in casual or colloquial contexts, despite the fact that not all gulls are coastal or marine birds. The term 'seagull' is widely accepted and used in everyday language, even though it is technically imprecise. The meme plays on this by suggesting a more playful alternative name.",
